                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "This dataset contains files with the letter metadata from and to Willem I van Orange (1533-1584) for the year 1572 (extracted from the inventory of his entire correspondence here: https://www.huygens.knaw.nl/resources/briefwisseling-van-willem-van-oranje/), and a selection of the related second-degree network of correspondents from the Catalogus Epistularum Neerlandicarum (CEN) curated by the SKILLNET project (https://doi.org/10.34894/G8XQI0)."
