    "files": [
      {
        "description": "This file contains 511 letters aggregated from: a selection of the correspondence from Willem I from the year 1572 (letters sent to him and by him on that year, a total of 394 letters). Next, using the names of the correspondents for that year, a mapping was done to the Catalogus Epistolarum Neerlandicarum (CEN) (cleaned version by Skillnet deposited here: DOI to add). For the names that matched, the letters were extracted (a total of 117 letters) and were aggregated with the initial dataset. See more information in the readme.txt file for this dataset.",
